I am back in my flat.
I carry the bags into the kitchen.
I unpack everything.
First I take the cheese.
I put the cheese straight into the fridge.
The bread and the coffee go into the cupboard.
I also have tomatoes and apples.
I like apples a lot.
I need a bowl.
I put the tomatoes and the apples into the bowl.
I put the bowl on the table.
My cupboards are no longer empty.
They are finally full again.
The kohlrabi does not go into the fridge.
It stays here in the kitchen.
I do not know this vegetable.
I also have no recipe.
But I want to try the kohlrabi.
I want to cook it tomorrow.
Now I make my lunch.
